      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Three historic Main Street buildings earned spots on the National Register of Historic Places, preserving Wise's 19th‑century charm.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wise%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every July, re‑enactors gather in Wise for a Civil War Living History Presentation, reenacting battles on the town's historic streets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wise%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Wise hosts the University of Virginia's College at Wise, a regional hub for higher education and research.",
